Original work (PolyForm Noncommercial 1.0.0): app.py, worker.py, gpu_pick.py, ui.html, selftest.py, setup.sh, README.md

Models (not bundled — downloaded from Hugging Face on first use, ~58GB + ~58GB):
  Qwen/Qwen-Image-2512       (https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen-Image-2512, Apache-2.0) — text → image
  Qwen/Qwen-Image-Edit-2509  (https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen-Image-Edit-2509, Apache-2.0) — image editing
  Alibaba Qwen 팀. 모델 카드의 license 필드로 확인(2026-10-12).
Runtime: PyTorch (BSD-3), Hugging Face diffusers / transformers / accelerate / safetensors (Apache-2.0), Pillow (MIT-CMU),
  NVIDIA CUDA 런타임 휠 (NVIDIA 라이선스, torch 와 함께 설치 — 동봉 안 함).
LLM for prompt refinement (optional, not bundled): Ollama (MIT) serving Google Gemma 4 (gemma4:31b, Apache-2.0);
  단독 실행 기본값 qwen3:8b (Apache-2.0).

Generated images: you are responsible for how you use them. Do not create images of real people without consent,
impersonation, or sexual content; the server always adds an NSFW negative prompt.
